# Automatically requests reviews and, once "Require review from Code Owners" is switched on in the
# "Protect main" ruleset, makes them mandatory. The LAST matching pattern wins.
# Keep in sync with docs/TEAM.md and the "Lead-only" row in AGENTS.md (section 3).
#
# Only Nour's GitHub handle is known today. As soon as the teammates' usernames are known, fill in
# the placeholders at the bottom and switch that setting on (docs/LEAD_SETUP.md): that is what makes
# the zone rules mechanical instead of relying on people and AIs behaving.
#
# There is deliberately NO catch-all "*" line. Unlisted paths (apps/, templates/, static/) stay
# unowned until their group lines below are filled in, so switching the setting on cannot make Nour
# a bottleneck for every PR.

